# basic-memory ignore rules for the rhyme-dna knowledge base.
#
# IMPORTANT: basic-memory 0.21.6 local sync does NOT read this repo-level file.
# It only reads the GLOBAL ignore file at ~/.basic-memory/.bmignore (see
# basic_memory/ignore_utils.py -> get_bmignore_path / load_bmignore_patterns).
# The patterns below are mirrored there; this file documents the intent in-repo
# and is honored by `bm cloud upload` / `bm cloud bisync` and (hopefully) future
# versions that support project-level ignores.
#
# Goal: index only the markdown knowledge notes (the root governance docs and
# kb/), NOT the pipeline code, data, audio, generated artifacts, or binaries.
#
# Note: the matcher is fnmatch-based and does NOT support negation (!), so this
# is a denylist, not an allowlist.

python/
data/
input/
output/
m4a/
full_songs/
generated_html/
textfiles/
*.ipynb
*.exe
*.pdf
*.mp3
*.wav
*.csv
*.TextGrid
*.jsonl
_article_*
_debug_*
conftest.py
skills-lock.json
